Note on prior work

The technique this script automates is intended Tomcat functionality used with
valid credentials, so there is no vulnerability and no discoverer to credit.

The JSP reverse shell is a derivative. Its StreamConnector skeleton is modified
from the code published at:

  http://www.security.org.sg/code/jspreverse.html

The same page is cited as the origin in Metasploit's JSP payload generator,
lib/msf/core/payload/jsp.rb.

That page states no licence. The MIT grant above is offered for the changes
made in this version, which are the Python driver and the modifications to the
JSP listed in the README. It is not a relicensing of the original author's
work, and the citation is kept in the header of exploit.py.
